<title>JAPAN: Sawako Corp -97/98 group forecast.</title>
<headline>Sawako Corp -97/98 group forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31, 1998</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Group)		FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		 28.97		20.00		15.74</p>
<p> Current		2.46		 1.47		 1.22</p>
<p> Net		    1.29	     788    million	 658    million</p>
<p>NOTE - Sawako Corporation is a general contractor based</p>
<p>in central Japan. Sawako said on Tuesday that it had decided</p>
<p>to buy 700,000 shares in Tokyo-based construction firm Fuji</p>
<p>Construction through third party allocation of shares.</p>
<p>The value of the share purchase will be 385 million yen,</p>
<p>Sawako said. Payment date is September 24, it said.</p>
<p>After the share purchase, Sawako will have a 72.9 percent</p>
<p>stake in the construction company, sawako said.</p>
</text>
